            "title": "PainReform completes acquisition of DeepSolar",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "PainReform (PRFX) announced closing of its previously announced acquisition of 100% of the business activity of DeepSolar, an AI-driven solar analytics platform, from BladeRanger. With the transaction now complete, PainReform aims to broaden DeepSolar\u2019s customer base, as well as increase penetration within existing customers, targeting major utility-scale solar operators, independent power producers, and residential solar users. PainReform expects DeepSolar to contribute long-term value by: Gene",
